olding a narrow but real edge heading into the final weeks.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6957, "margin": 2.83}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6748, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6753, "margin": 2.5}]}